{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":17962,\"title\":\"After Life\",\"tagline\":\"What is the one memory you would take with you?\",\"overview\":\"On a cold Monday morning, a group of counselors clock in at an old-fashioned social services office. Their task is to interview the recently deceased, record their personal details, then, over the course of the week, assist them in choosing a single memory to keep for eternity.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bs2M1hqAQl5LeAOPPRV4drwouZS.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pXOsdvH4xuprxGmZMiCJsRAowi7.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"voteCount\":311,\"year\":1999,\"runtime\":118,\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Drama\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"JP\",\"name\":\"Japan\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Hirokazu Kore-eda\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":25645,\"name\":\"Hirokazu Kore-eda\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9Quu2Jo5ItVgs8V1YPCaLEHc8y1.jpg\"},{\"id\":82540,\"name\":\"Arata Iura\",\"character\":\"Takashi Mochizuki\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uJbyT6FDqDfVZKXpkDvRDS7NcQj.jpg\"},{\"id\":82541,\"name\":\"Erika Oda\",\"character\":\"Shiori Satonaka\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xsmYGqzw0YB5xEtpj5z5Ze7rF6y.jpg\"},{\"id\":4990,\"name\":\"Susumu Terajima\",\"character\":\"Satoru Kawashima\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ls7hOjfFjOOTow7x0IP4GhcCeJf.jpg\"},{\"id\":19590,\"name\":\"Takashi Naito\",\"character\":\"Takuro Sugie\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xwsm0ygjG79jLIogutwo6r64igy.jpg\"},{\"id\":82542,\"name\":\"Kei Tani\",\"character\":\"Kennosuke Nakamura\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9hjm6SmvqQJ4IGwBAeqyAWwYe0i.jpg\"},{\"id\":34374,\"name\":\"Kyōko Kagawa\",\"character\":\"Kyoko Watanabe\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/q47wPwySJvhj6HQoYb7ON1TjbcV.jpg\"},{\"id\":1029304,\"name\":\"Tōru Yuri\",\"character\":\"Gisuke