snFM00mpNAfUzUtkdEW0uDEvXA0.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sl5NJ1vtyhP9Vr88bB4blULsJYp.jpg\",\"rating\":8.5,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Prue and her classmate Curtis are drawn into a magical forest filled with enchanted creatures, loyal allies, and formidable adversaries as they embark on a desperate quest to rescue Prue's abducted baby brother from a murder of crows led by a mysterious woman named Alexandra.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Adventure\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":8966,\"title\":\"Twilight\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3Gkb6jm6962ADUPaCBqzz9CTbn9.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/weAYfu6FfrNxEDJ3xH1XpgQcqUv.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When Bella Swan moves to a small town in the Pacific Northwest, she falls in love with Edward Cullen, a mysterious classmate who reveals himself to be a 108-year-old vampire. Despite Edward's repeated cautions, Bella can't stay away from him, a fatal move that endangers her own life.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":17979,\"title\":\"A Christmas Carol\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xNwlAIdx1Ln28GRiQttUP9Gojy2.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uocpNfrP0Vvnf2UxykXuIR1HNUd.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Miser Ebenezer Scrooge is awakened on Christmas Eve by spirits who reveal to him his own miserable existence, what opportunities he wasted in his youth, his current cruelties, and the dire fate that awaits him if he does not change his ways. Scrooge is faced with his own story of growing bitterness and meanness, and must decide what his own future will hold: death or redemption.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":18239,\"title\":\"The Twilight Saga: New Moon\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/k2qTooPlHffgNABNWxeJdGMglPK.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dF2c20sRDgySZLaLS2OUerL07sz.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Forks, Washington resident Bella Swan is reeling from the departure of her vampire love, Edward Cullen, and finds comfort in her friendship with Jacob Black, a werewolf. But before she knows it, she's thrust into a centuries-old conflict, and her desire to be with Edward at any cost leads her to take greater and greater risks.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":508442,\"title\":\"Soul\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hm58Jw4Lw8OIeECIq5qyPYhAeRJ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rQaHA74pevnGsxcKGaoZVGWe9TC.jpg\",\"rating\":8.1,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Joe Gardner is a middle school teacher with a love for jazz music. After a successful audition at the Half Note Club, he suddenly gets into an accident that separates his soul from his body and is transported to the You Seminar, a center in which souls develop and gain passions before being transported to a newborn child. Joe must enlist help from the other souls-in-training, like 22, a soul who has spent eons in the You Seminar, in order to get back to Earth.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Drama\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1062722,\"title\":\"Frankenstein\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/g4JtvGlQO7DByTI6frUobqvSL3R.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hpXBJxLD2SEf8l2CspmSeiHrBKX.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Dr. Victor Frankenstein, a brilliant but egotistical scientist, brings a creature to life in a monstrous experiment that ultimately leads to the undoing of both the creator and his tragic creation.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Fantasy\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":150689,\"title\":\"Cinderella\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/j91LJmcWo16CArFOoapsz84bwxb.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/q7vmCCmyiHnuKGMzHZlr0fD44b9.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When her father unexpectedly passes away, young Ella finds herself at the mercy of her cruel stepmother and her daughters. Never one to give up hope, Ella's fortunes begin to change after meeting a dashing stranger in the woods.\",\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Fantasy\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":4922,\"title\":\"The Curious Case of Benjamin Button\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/26wEWZYt6yJkwRVkjcbwJEFh9IS.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2fswjyrY3GEzeoVn6mF8pNeNcgf.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Born under unusual circumstances, Benjamin Button springs into being as an elderly man in a New Orleans nursing home and ages in reverse. Twelve years after his birth, he meets Daisy, a child who flits in and out of his life as she grows up to be a dancer. Though he has all sorts of unusual adventures over the course of his life, it is his relationship with Daisy, and the hope that they will come together at the right time, that drives Benjamin forward.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Fantasy\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1417,\"title\":\"Pan's Labyrinth\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/khBQ6nN5FLfg9XgPXIZDkABJjqo.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6G6nqSW9S7EHA9HrYl0Z8uo2H7f.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"year\":2006,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In post–civil war Spain, 10-year-old Ofelia moves with her pregnant mother to live under the control of her cruel stepfather. Drawn into a mysterious labyrinth, she meets a faun who reveals that she may be a lost princess from an underground kingdom. To return to her true father, she must complete a series of surreal and perilous tasks that blur the line between reality and fantasy.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Drama\",\"War\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":402431,\"title\":\"Wicked\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xDGbZ0JJ3mYaGKy4Nzd9Kph6M9L.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/w22GVYotTIVC1dUd58mRhwPqiS.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In the land of Oz, ostracized and misunderstood green-skinned Elphaba is forced to share a room with the popular aristocrat Glinda at Shiz University, and the two's unlikely friendship is tested as they begin to fulfill their respective destinies as Glinda the Good and the Wicked Witch of the West.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Romance\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":843963,\"title\":\"Touch\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5s4AucmyqAnCPIhSwNp7kLhhhdh.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":8,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Mountains silhouetted at dawn. Wind rustling through the tall grass. A woman carries a chair across mountains. Where to?\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"f8K_YxtdzRo\",\"name\":\"After Life (1998) ORIGINAL TRAILER [HQ]\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"DN9sr5wVkik\",\"name\":\"After Life (1998) trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}